{"step_index":518,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T03:01:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-18T12:01:31+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-18T12:01:34+09:00\nThe search for \"\"THE5musicSHEET\" OR \"051-517-8828\" OR \"517-8828\"\" returned the following summary:\nThe search results provided do not contain any information regarding \"THE5musicSHEET.\"\n\nRegarding the phone numbers:\n*   **347-517-8828** is associated with **B2B Real Estate Group Inc.** and **Budget Real Estate NYC Inc.** in New York, specifically linked to real estate agent **Inbal Levy**[1][2][3][4].\n*   **02-517-8828** (an older Seoul, South Korea number) was historically listed for the **National Merit Scholarship Foundation** (국가유공자 장학재단) in a 2007 document[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [zillow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHMT_oXazenLtjc2LOrEK-hBXNVFcEUBtpznRreSWwUuMoPBv_0klIdInt_2Th_PDnPzmOm0fk5LN6yJqhX4oRgZQfSyR9MgR1DAz46_ZDvH3xQwBYMcj9Q9tBNtlh068ZDf_LWW0Szfw==)\n[2] [nystatemls.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGGXduoUHMM7he8Eqhj9VsBo85zypx6S5Z7nOrV6Ofg-NsUinx5U18-460cMMxo6fJp3jcBdmZLEVWVnWUPm9nj8SPx9fJ76ucGXjAVM5j3V5f3KvNr0bKhyHhcdmc47ibySayQfaP1KP3MW85GgLYFoU5KZMjHf6WVH5ipwx-YvG2jyBM=)\n[3] [sothebysrealty.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG2SnVIqVdCBjBXaXLhJ2kvglIT8Cqcu6K4ku4pdwBf-sZsoch9P72b7Y-Z6GONuLrymwHDE8wiAtJcI5QLU22RuDj2L9X1C1fngy7exA6O4q9eX4KvAqTLpK_0V1KT_7kMgj-5reHhjLgm56KcsI43gRCPwIsjuxJfExqtneCZFX0n6W1W5NjPka2PRUuwUms7oUIlhn9zkVJ-e2uRu4Gq09fmE3XrNwRIW1aXpQ==)\n[4] [zillow.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGqjwv245UkloGgsJg7lQNwEvbwIlxqEU8AB-WFPOMSztMasttlbihZQKm0LpQZVeDEnQNPUuMmIxefY1Pc4JzT50pKKzsiZoGyosF5Ludxtn2etEgxLVWr8AYJ615Hs0JdT-HgmeCNdQCWQtc2uhB6Z8firD0X4IszG4W9jrYShaXHzE1VhnXm)\n[5] [625family.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGOdXuv01QDQ